    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A sci-fi rail shooter for PC, PCVR and Mac</strong>\u00a0 (<i>also available free on iOS &amp; Android</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your train against waves of AI-controlled robots that run, fly, rocket and roll in pursuit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully destructible enemies</strong> \u2013 Voxels + physical simulation makes for infinite variation in the carnage you unleash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/c6aeb5e9a355335701d49852f9613103.poster.avif?t=1755187285\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/c6aeb5e9a355335701d49852f9613103.webm?t=1755187285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/c6aeb5e9a355335701d49852f9613103.mp4?t=1755187285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neural-network AI</strong> \u2013 Damaged bots limp, crawl or skid to keep the hunt alive.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/dad04c4fb2c28364788ab2a388a894b7.poster.avif?t=1755187285\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/dad04c4fb2c28364788ab2a388a894b7.webm?t=1755187285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/dad04c4fb2c28364788ab2a388a894b7.mp4?t=1755187285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable weapons &amp; power-ups</strong> -\u2028Rail guns, plasma weapons, lasers, missiles and a variety of powerups to fuel the destruction.   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/0cad0198fd3dac9642ce80a3c1277936.poster.avif?t=1755187285\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/0cad0198fd3dac9642ce80a3c1277936.webm?t=1755187285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/0cad0198fd3dac9642ce80a3c1277936.mp4?t=1755187285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional VR</strong>\u2028- Immerse yourself in the chase. Unique integrated zooming allows you to make that distant sharp shot while keeping a gunsight on the enemies at your heels. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/97bd8c5c0be837c159a08876191031ab.poster.avif?t=1755187285\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/97bd8c5c0be837c159a08876191031ab.webm?t=1755187285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/97bd8c5c0be837c159a08876191031ab.mp4?t=1755187285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two game modes</strong>   <br>\u2003\u2022 <i>Chase</i> \u2013 survive endless pursuit, holding out for the next supply carriage while pushing for the highest score.   <br>\u2003\u2022 <i>Node Assault</i> \u2013 fight through the defenders and destroy the enemy brain-train to continue your progress towards new weapons and powerups. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Typical first clear \u2014 10 - 12 hours; endless score-chasing beyond that. Single-player only. Free to play, one optional purchase unlocks all weapons &amp; power-ups.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A sci-fi rail shooter for PC, PCVR and Mac</strong>\u00a0 (<i>also available free on iOS &amp; Android</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your train against waves of AI-controlled robots that run, fly, rocket and roll in pursuit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully destructible enemies</strong> \u2013 Voxels + physical simulation makes for infinite variation in the carnage you unleash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/c6aeb5e9a355335701d49852f9613103.poster.avif?t=1755187285\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/c6aeb5e9a355335701d49852f9613103.webm?t=1755187285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/c6aeb5e9a355335701d49852f9613103.mp4?t=1755187285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neural-network AI</strong> \u2013 Damaged bots limp, crawl or skid to keep the hunt alive.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/dad04c4fb2c28364788ab2a388a894b7.poster.avif?t=1755187285\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/dad04c4fb2c28364788ab2a388a894b7.webm?t=1755187285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/dad04c4fb2c28364788ab2a388a894b7.mp4?t=1755187285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable weapons &amp; power-ups</strong> -\u2028Rail guns, plasma weapons, lasers, missiles and a variety of powerups to fuel the destruction.   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/0cad0198fd3dac9642ce80a3c1277936.poster.avif?t=1755187285\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/0cad0198fd3dac9642ce80a3c1277936.webm?t=1755187285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/0cad0198fd3dac9642ce80a3c1277936.mp4?t=1755187285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional VR</strong>\u2028- Immerse yourself in the chase. Unique integrated zooming allows you to make that distant sharp shot while keeping a gunsight on the enemies at your heels. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/97bd8c5c0be837c159a08876191031ab.poster.avif?t=1755187285\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/97bd8c5c0be837c159a08876191031ab.webm?t=1755187285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/97bd8c5c0be837c159a08876191031ab.mp4?t=1755187285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two game modes</strong>   <br>\u2003\u2022 <i>Chase</i> \u2013 survive endless pursuit, holding out for the next supply carriage while pushing for the highest score.   <br>\u2003\u2022 <i>Node Assault</i> \u2013 fight through the defenders and destroy the enemy brain-train to continue your progress towards new weapons and powerups. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Typical first clear \u2014 10 - 12 hours; endless score-chasing beyond that. Single-player only. Free to play, one optional purchase unlocks all weapons &amp; power-ups.</p>",
